  "purpose": "Canonical identity map for accessory acquisition layers. One canonical accessory identity may have multiple PQ, shop, raid, gift, wish, DLC, or event routes.",
  "identity_rules": [
    "Exact cosmetic variants with different names or colors remain separate identities unless evidence establishes they are the same inventory item.",
