    "Historical aliases are preserved as aliases rather than silently rewriting source terminology.",
    "Unresolved naming conflicts remain unresolved until independent evidence reconciles them.",
    "Shop candidates promoted here remain partially verified until their cross-layer acquisition history is reconciled."
  ],
